  "Eurostat and UNHCR counts, US and Canadian programme arrivals; see research/{n0}-{n1}/gaps/refugees-notes.md": "dane Eurostatu i UNHCR, przyjazdy w ramach programów USA i Kanady; zob. research/{n0}-{n1}/gaps/refugees-notes.md",
